          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/react-native-webview/pulls/24",
          "merged_at": "2023-01-13T20:29:08Z"
        },
        "body": "In order to keep the webview attached all time, a new prop `temporaryParentNodeTag` is introduced. When the webview is unmounted, the internal webview is remounted under the temporary parent.\r\n\r\nTested on iOS and Android\r\n\r\nhttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1707258/212413190-48a2599b-048a-4877-bae2-537d13b64bea.mp4\r\n\r\n",
