          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/react-native-webview/pulls/23",
          "merged_at": "2022-12-20T20:19:11Z"
        },
        "body": "~~it seems like looping audio doesn't seem to be necessary~~\r\n\r\n~~when the audio track is not looped, I don't see a bunch of worker threads being spawned to play the audio~~\r\n\r\nInstead of looping the inaudible audio, the audio is played every 2 seconds and when the app is foregrounded. I couldn't find a way to know when the WkWebView audio session category changes, as it would be better to play the audio element only when needed.\r\n\r\n",
