        "pull_request": {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/react-native-webview/pulls/21",
          "merged_at": "2022-11-21T17:05:36Z"
        },
        "body": "I was trying to make a button-click in the web page in the WebView conditionally load an iframe. Loading the iframe successfully depends on the navigation delegate as I learned from https://stackoverflow.com/questions/41250162/wkwebview-not-loading-content-from-iframe-on-a-webpage , and I realized the navigation delegate wasn't getting reconnected properly when attaching the WKWebView to a new RNCWebView. See additional context in https://github.com/react-native-webview/react-native-webview/pull/2469/files#r1026979105 .",
