        "body": "The background style on the `WebView` react component wasn't propagating to the internal WebView, so this PR\r\n- applies the RNCWebView background color (which should be the same as the CSS background color in React) to the InternalWebView\r\nand\r\n- defaults the InternalWebView background color to transparent",
